{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"庄子·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"zhuangzi","categoryLabel":"庄子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/25_zhuangzi/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"庄子-生平与时代\">庄子·生平与时代</h1><p>本 hub 追溯庄子（约公元前369—前286年）清贫而自由的一生，及其所处的战国乱世背景。庄子名周，宋国蒙人，曾任卑微的&quot;漆园吏&quot;，却拒绝楚威王的相位之聘，宁愿&quot;曳尾于涂中&quot;——本 hub 要回答的，是这位道家宗师<strong>是谁、经历了什么、生活在怎样的时代</strong>，而非他的思想&quot;说了什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>庄子专题共六个姊妹 hub，各有明确边界，本 hub 只负责&quot;生平与时代&quot;这一层，其余交叉引用而不重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>1 生平与时代（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>庄子是谁、经历、时代</td>\n<td>起点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>庄子&quot;新增&quot;了什么（综合判断）</td>\n<td>本 hub 提供生平依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>逍遥、齐物等观念本身</td>\n<td>本 hub 只点到，不展开义理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要著作</a></td>\n<td>《庄子》文本形态与表达艺术</td>\n<td>本 hub 引用寓言作生平佐证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>身后两千年的影响史</td>\n<td>本 hub 是其源头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>避世/相对主义等争议的辩证评判</td>\n<td>本 hub 不下评判，留待此处</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>凡涉及&quot;逃避还是超越&quot;&quot;作者真伪&quot;等评判性问题，本 hub 一律不展开，交由 hub 6。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>无需哲学前置即可阅读本 hub。建议按&quot;史料骨架 → 人生抉择 → 时代根源&quot;的顺序：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1 生平与传说&lt;br/&gt;史料骨架] --&gt; B[2 漆园吏&lt;br/&gt;唯一可考职务]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 拒绝相位&lt;br/&gt;定义性抉择]&#10;    C --&gt; D[4 清贫与自由&lt;br/&gt;人生境界]&#10;    D --&gt; E[5 乱世的背景&lt;br/&gt;时代根源]&#10;    E --&gt; F[6 老子与道家&lt;br/&gt;思想渊源]&#10;    F --&gt; G[进阶: hub 3 思想与方法]\">flowchart LR\n    A[1 生平与传说&lt;br/&gt;史料骨架] --&gt; B[2 漆园吏&lt;br/&gt;唯一可考职务]\n    B --&gt; C[3 拒绝相位&lt;br/&gt;定义性抉择]\n    C --&gt; D[4 清贫与自由&lt;br/&gt;人生境界]\n    D --&gt; E[5 乱世的背景&lt;br/&gt;时代根源]\n    E --&gt; F[6 老子与道家&lt;br/&gt;思想渊源]\n    F --&gt; G[进阶: hub 3 思想与方法]</pre><ol>\n<li><a href=\"the-man-from-meng/life-and-legend\">生平与传说</a> — 先建立史料/传说的边界。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-man-from-meng/the-lacquer-garden-official\">漆园吏</a> — 唯一可考的职务与人生起点。</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-recluse-by-choice/refusing-the-prime-minister\">拒绝相位</a> — &quot;曳尾于涂中&quot;，最具定义性的抉择。</li>\n<li><a href=\"a-recluse-by-choice/poverty-and-freedom\">清贫与自由</a> — 清贫与自由如何相互成就。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-warring-states-era/an-age-of-chaos\">乱世的背景</a> — 战国与宋国，思想的时代土壤。</li>\n<li><a href=\"the-warring-states-era/laozi-and-the-daoist-stream\">老子与道家</a> — 师承渊源，通向其思想。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"跨人物参照\">跨人物参照</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../laozi/life-and-times/\">老子</a> — 道家奠基者，&quot;老庄&quot;之&quot;老&quot;，庄子思想的直接源头。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../confucius/life-and-times/\">孔子</a> — 同处礼崩乐坏之世，儒道两家对乱世开出截然不同的药方，是理解庄子选择的最佳对照。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本 hub，建议接续 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">庄子·思想与方法</a>，把&quot;其人其世&quot;转入&quot;其思其学&quot;。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-man-from-meng","title":"The Man From Meng","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-man-from-meng","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-legend","title":"生平与传说","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-man-from-meng/life-and-legend"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-lacquer-garden-official","title":"漆园吏","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-man-from-meng/the-lacquer-garden-official"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-recluse-by-choice","title":"A Recluse By Choice","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/a-recluse-by-choice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"refusing-the-prime-minister","title":"拒绝相位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/a-recluse-by-choice/refusing-the-prime-minister"},{"seq":2,"slug":"poverty-and-freedom","title":"清贫与自由","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/a-recluse-by-choice/poverty-and-freedom"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-warring-states-era","title":"The Warring States Era","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-warring-states-era","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"an-age-of-chaos","title":"乱世的背景","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-warring-states-era/an-age-of-chaos"},{"seq":2,"slug":"laozi-and-the-daoist-stream","title":"老子与道家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-warring-states-era/laozi-and-the-daoist-stream"}]}]}